Overall, while there are legal risks to flag, particularly related to GDPR compliance and data sovereignty, our company context suggests we have a solid foundation for addressing these concerns. We will need to carefully review and adapt our contractual terms and processes to ensure full alignment with the EU AI Act, GDPR, and other relevant frameworks.
